    },
    {
      "id": "timeline_f1f4a066926e",
      "order": 65,
      "knownAtStart": false,
      "description": "陆照临循声来到井边，发现敲击声来自井下石梯。"
    }
  ],
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "beat_chapter_063",
      "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
      "summary": "老妇没有回答，端起空碗离开。",
      "narrativeBrief": [
        {
          "text": "旧水道的出口在一处荒坡。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1725,
            "end": 1725
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临爬出石缝时，天刚蒙蒙亮。山外的雨比玄霄宗稀薄，却更冷，雨丝被风斜斜吹过来，打在脸上像细砂。顾长离最后出来，她把石缝旁的藤蔓重新拢好，又用泥土盖住脚印。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1727,
            "end": 1727
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“有人追来吗？”陆照临问。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1729,
            "end": 1729
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“暂时没有。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1731,
            "end": 1731
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“你怎么知道？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1733,
            "end": 1733
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "顾长离指向坡下。泥地上有一排新脚印，脚印从远处来，到荒坡便折向东侧，没有靠近水道出口。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1735,
            "end": 1735
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“他们在找正路。”她说，“我们走偏了。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1737,
            "end": 1737
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "叶观澜说过，第一座驿站不点灯。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1763,
            "end": 1763
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "石屋门没有锁。陆照临推门进去，霉味扑面而来。墙角堆着腐烂的草席，柜台后留着一面布满划痕的木板。木板上写着来往人名，最近一笔是三年前冬至前七日。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1765,
            "end": 1765
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "那一行只剩两个字：陆沉。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1767,
            "end": 1767
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“舟字被刮掉了。”顾长离说。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1769,
            "end": 1769
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“有人不想留下全名。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1771,
            "end": 1771
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“也可能当时只写了两个字。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1773,
            "end": 1773
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临摸了摸木板，指腹沾上黑灰。黑灰里混着一粒细小的铜屑，与顾氏账单上的印记相同。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1775,
            "end": 1775
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "驿站后墙有一道窄门。门内堆着旧灯具，灯罩大多破损，唯有一盏还完整。陆照临刚靠近，那盏灯便轻轻摇动。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1777,
            "end": 1777
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "他没有触碰，而是蹲下看灯座。灯座下压着一张油纸，油纸包着三枚铜钱。铜钱正面刻着“无”，背面刻着“灯”。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1779,
            "end": 1779
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“给谁的？”顾长离问。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1781,
            "end": 1781
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“也许给后来的人。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1783,
            "end": 1783
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“那我们算后来的人吗？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1785,
            "end": 1785
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“至少有人这么希望。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1787,
            "end": 1787
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "屋外突然传来马蹄声。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1789,
            "end": 1789
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "两人立即熄灭手里的小灯，退到旧灯具后。马蹄在驿站外停下，随后有人跳下马。来人没有敲门，先绕屋走了一圈，靴底踩过门前的苔藓。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1791,
            "end": 1791
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“里面有人。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1793,
            "end": 1793
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "声音年轻而冷。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1795,
            "end": 1795
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "顾长离把铜针夹在指间。陆照临握住短刀，掌心残印微微发热。门外的人推门而入，穿一身灰布短褂，腰间挂着玄霄宗的制式令牌。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1797,
            "end": 1797
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“戒律堂搜查。”那人说，“有人携带宗门禁物下山，见到可疑者，立即报信。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1799,
            "end": 1799
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "他举起一张画像。画像上的脸被墨涂黑，只留下姓名：陆照临。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1801,
            "end": 1801
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临屏住呼吸。灰布弟子在屋里走了一圈，手指在柜台木板上停住。他看见“陆沉”两个字，低声道：“又是这一笔。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1803,
            "end": 1803
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“师兄知道这是谁？”旁边的人问。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1805,
            "end": 1805
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“不知道。三年前每座驿站都有。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1807,
            "end": 1807
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“为什么后来没有了？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1809,
            "end": 1809
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“因为有人把路封了。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1811,
            "end": 1811
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "两人正要往后墙走，屋外忽然传来一声犬吠。灰布弟子回头，抓起柜台上的油纸包。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1813,
            "end": 1813
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "顾长离突然弹出一枚铜针。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1815,
            "end": 1815
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "铜针钉在门框上，发出清脆的一声。灰布弟子拔剑转身，陆照临趁机踢倒旧灯具。破裂的灯罩滚满地面，扬起大片灰尘。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1817,
            "end": 1817
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "两人从后墙窄门冲出，沿驿站后的沟渠向东跑。身后传来呵斥与马蹄，追兵没有立刻追上，显然被倒塌的灯具绊住。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1819,
            "end": 1819
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "沟渠尽头是一座石桥。桥下水流很急，水面漂着一盏小灯。小灯没有火，却逆流向上，停在桥墩旁。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1821,
            "end": 1821
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临认出灯柄上的黑色铜丝。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1823,
            "end": 1823
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“是那个人的灯。”他说。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1825,
            "end": 1825
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "顾长离没有让他靠近：“桥上有人。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1827,
            "end": 1827
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "石桥另一端站着一个撑伞的人，青衫洗得发白，正是叶观澜。他没有看追兵，只望着桥下的灯。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1829,
            "end": 1829
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“你们比我预想得快。”他说。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1831,
            "end": 1831
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“你故意把线索放在驿站？”陆照临问。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1833,
            "end": 1833
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“我只把该回到路上的东西放回路上。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1835,
            "end": 1835
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“玄霄宗为什么追捕我？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1837,
            "end": 1837
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“因为你带走了不该离山的印记。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1839,
            "end": 1839
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“你知道残印是什么？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1841,
            "end": 1841
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "叶观澜笑意很淡：“我知道它会让人记起不愿记起的事。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1843,
            "end": 1843
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "追兵的声音从沟渠上方传来，越来越近。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1845,
            "end": 1845
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“你不一起走？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1849,
            "end": 1849
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "无灯镇到了。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1863,
            "end": 1863
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临改口：“三名从玄霄宗来的引灯人。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1911,
            "end": 1911
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "老妇的手停在半空。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1913,
            "end": 1913
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“这里不收引灯人。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1915,
            "end": 1915
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“三年前呢？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1917,
            "end": 1917
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“三年前也不收。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1919,
            "end": 1919
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "她转身要走，陆照临看见她腰间挂着一块旧木牌。木牌上刻着半盏灯，缺口处嵌着灰白石屑。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1921,
            "end": 1921
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“这块牌子从哪里来的？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1923,
            "end": 1923
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "老妇低头看了看：“捡的。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1925,
            "end": 1925
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“在哪里？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1927,
            "end": 1927
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“井边。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1929,
            "end": 1929
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“镇里有井？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1931,
            "end": 1931
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "老妇没有回答，端起空碗离开。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1933,
            "end": 1933
          }
        }
      ],
