          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1777,
            "end": 1777
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "他没有触碰，而是蹲下看灯座。灯座下压着一张油纸，油纸包着三枚铜钱。铜钱正面刻着“无”，背面刻着“灯”。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1779,
            "end": 1779
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“给谁的？”顾长离问。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1781,
            "end": 1781
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“也许给后来的人。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1783,
            "end": 1783
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“那我们算后来的人吗？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1785,
            "end": 1785
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“至少有人这么希望。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1787,
            "end": 1787
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "屋外突然传来马蹄声。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1789,
            "end": 1789
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "两人立即熄灭手里的小灯，退到旧灯具后。马蹄在驿站外停下，随后有人跳下马。来人没有敲门，先绕屋走了一圈，靴底踩过门前的苔藓。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1791,
            "end": 1791
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“里面有人。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1793,
            "end": 1793
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "声音年轻而冷。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1795,
            "end": 1795
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "顾长离把铜针夹在指间。陆照临握住短刀，掌心残印微微发热。门外的人推门而入，穿一身灰布短褂，腰间挂着玄霄宗的制式令牌。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1797,
            "end": 1797
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“戒律堂搜查。”那人说，“有人携带宗门禁物下山，见到可疑者，立即报信。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1799,
            "end": 1799
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "他举起一张画像。画像上的脸被墨涂黑，只留下姓名：陆照临。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1801,
            "end": 1801
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临屏住呼吸。灰布弟子在屋里走了一圈，手指在柜台木板上停住。他看见“陆沉”两个字，低声道：“又是这一笔。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1803,
            "end": 1803
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“为什么后来没有了？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 1809,
            "end": 1809
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“没有名字的人。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-094",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2084,
            "end": 2084
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“他现在在哪里？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-095",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2086,
            "end": 2086
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“在每一盏不该亮的灯后面。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-096",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2088,
            "end": 2088
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "老妇说完，吹灭桌上的蜡烛。屋里彻底陷入黑暗，只有墙上那条青线仍在一点点向低地延伸。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-097",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2090,
            "end": 2090
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临听见自己的呼吸，也听见门外那行脚印停在了门槛前。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-098",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2092,
            "end": 2092
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "门外没有人说话。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-099",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2094,
            "end": 2094
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "只有雨声越来越近。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-100",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2096,
            "end": 2096
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "像潮水。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-101",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2098,
            "end": 2098
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "无边无际。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-102",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2100,
            "end": 2100
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "极暗。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-103",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2102,
            "end": 2102
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "无灯镇白日也不点灯，居民以手势确认彼此身份。陆照临借宿时发现，镇上每户人家门口都有一盆清水，水面映出的不是屋顶，而是各自最害怕忘记的地方。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-104",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2104,
            "end": 2104
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "无灯镇的居民用白布蒙住门窗，仿佛害怕月光照进来。陆照临借宿在铁匠家，夜里听见院外有人敲井栏。铁匠不敢开门，只把一把生锈的钥匙交给他，说镇中每隔十年便会少一个孩子。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-105",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 2106,
            "end": 2106
          }
        }
      ],
